SRR12983361	PRJNA674657	SRP291201	SAMN16667045	SRX9434953	Homo sapiens	AAVS1 non-targeting sgRNA knockout clone 1	AAVS1 non-targeting sgRNA knockout clone 1	NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM4880582: AAVS1 non-targeting sgRNA knockout clone 1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	NextSeq 500	RNA from 1 million clonal NALM-6 cells of the indicated genotypes was extracted using the QIAGEN Mini Rneasy kit according to the manufacturer's protocol. RNA purity was assessed using a nanodrop spectrophotometer (260/280 nm) and RNA was quantified by QuBit (ABI). RNA quality was assessed with a Bioanalyzer RNA 6000 Nano assay on a 2100 Bioanalyzer (Agilent Technologies). One microgram of total RNA was used for library preparation, which was carried out using the KAPA mRNAseq Hyperprep kit (KAPA, #KK8581). Libraries were quantified using QuBit and Bioanalyzer instruments, and diluted to 10 nM before normalization by qPCR using the KAPA library quantification kit (KAPA, #KK4973). Libraries were then pooled to equimolar concentration.	6735444	572512740	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR129/061/SRR12983361/SRR12983361.fastq.gz	9b8dc03f6329686f4145d1b4a1a24c33	320862328
